  "description": "“Lee Seo-Yoon, have you ever kissed before?”  \nSeo-yoon and Ji-ho, whose relationship became awkward after sharing their sweet and bitter chocolate-flavored first kiss together.  \nAfter graduating from high school, I never thought I’d see him again… Seo-yoon appears in front of Jiho again with a 180 degree change.  \nWill the two be able to sort out their past feelings and become good friends again? - Madeleine Scans --\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/peachcrush), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/peachcrush)",
